OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day for most with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and light winds. Staying
OL,7,Fpredominantly dry, though an odd
OL,8,Fafternoon shower is possible, chiefly
OL,9,Ffor Cornwall and northern Scotland,
OL,10,Fwith cloud amounts building here
OL,11,Fduring the day. Feeling pleasant in
OL,12,Fthe sunshine.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRemaining cloudier over
OL,15,Fnorthern Scotland with a few light
OL,16,Fshowers. Elsewhere, a chilly night
OL,17,Fwith prolonged clear spells and the
OL,18,Fodd mist or fog patch forming in rural
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
