OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FHigh pressure brings another
OL,6,Fsettled and largely dry day with sunny
OL,7,Fspells, variable cloud and light
OL,8,Fwinds. An isolated shower possible
OL,9,Fnear northern coasts. Temperatures a
OL,10,Flittle higher than Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
